note: "English source: Custom. Tag group for tags the user or an agent created freely, with no fixed taxonomy. It is also the fallback group for a tag with an empty category. Small muted header above that category's tag rows in the Tags section; an adjective heading over a group of tags (inflect as the target language requires), no placeholders. Names the category, not a count. The raw category string is printed as a data fallback for a category a newer backend adds that this catalogue does not know."

